4. How Virtual Art Design uses information collected
Virtual Art Design uses your information only as follows:
•To provide our products and services to you and fulfil your specific requests;
•To send you messages about our products and services, new products, features, enhancements, special offers, upgrade opportunities, contests and events of interest;
•To enable user-to-user communications;
•To better understand the behaviour and preferences of our Users, to troubleshoot technical problems, to deliver advertising, for the purposes of proper functioning of our products and services and improving them; to handle users accounts and all in-game payments.
•To improve our software and services by providing experiences and recommendations, language and location customization, personalized help and instructions.
• Virtual Art Design collects and uses Users personal information in association or through different API or SDK of Social Network Sites, Mobile Platforms, Data Analysis Networks or Mobile Ad Networks. By installing or using our services or games the User also agrees on any such additional Privacy Policy provided by such Site, Platform or Network. The following are some of such companies which are used on our Sites or in our Games or Apps, so you can check or opt-out of your data through their Privacy Policy forms: iTunes, Google Play, Amazon, FaceBook, Samsung Apps, Nook, AppAnnie, Flurry, Admob, Google Analitycs, GetJar, TapJoy, Paymentwall, SponsorPay, Vungle, AppLift, MobPartner, Unilead, YeahMobi, Chartboost, AdColony, Glispa, and many others.
